OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GPianist Alexander Malofeev joins
OL,6,     Gthe German Symphony Orchestra,
OL,7,     GBerlin and conductor Elim Chan in
OL,8,     GRachmaninov's 2nd Piano Concerto
OL,9,     Gand Prokofiev's Symphony no 5.
OL,10,     GJohn Shea presents.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GJohn Toal presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,16,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,17,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,18,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,19,     Gwith familiar favourites.
