OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Lives of Hildegard
OL,5,     Fof Bingen
OL,6,     GMedieval composer and polymath
OL,7,     GHildegard of Bingen navigates
OL,8,     Gchallenges as a prioress. A
OL,9,     Gfictionalised account, written by
OL,10,     GAnna Linstrum and performed by
OL,11,     GJuliet Stevenson.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
